## Issue 1: MEDIUM - Transcript Parsing is O(n) Per Event

**Problem:** `transform.rs:147-155` and `220-228` read all lines into memory, then slice to last N. O(n) per event can negate Rust performance gains on large transcripts.

**Current code:**
```rust
